.DS_Store
.DStore
**/ .DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
**/.DStore
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Credentials. LoomQ reads these at run time and never writes them anywhere.
# The rules forbid committing keys, tokens or account details, so every shape
# of the local secrets file is ignored here rather than relied on to be typed
# correctly.
secrets.env
*.secrets.env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
!starter_kit/**/*.qasm

# Local virtualenvs
.venv*/
venv*/
